        "summary": "Batch Annotate Annotation Queue Items",
        "description": "Records annotations for several items of one queue in a single call. Each entry is applied on its own, so the response carries one result per entry and a failure on one item does not stop the rest. `annotatorEmail` and `markAsCompleted` given at the top level apply to every entry that does not set its own.",
