      "post": {
        "operationId": "createEvaluationRule",
        "summary": "Create Evaluation Rule",
        "description": "Creates a standing rule that runs a metric collection against matching production traces, spans or threads as they arrive, and returns its id. Running metrics consumes LLM usage. The collection's turn type must match the rule — `THREAD` rules need a multi-turn collection, `TRACE` and `SPAN` rules a single-turn one — and only one enabled `THREAD` rule may target a given collection. Requires the Starter plan or above.",
