      "delete": {
        "operationId": "deleteGovernanceControl",
        "summary": "Delete Governance Control",
        "description": "Permanently deletes a governance control, every version of its definition, and every verdict recorded against it. Any policy holding the control loses it and stops applying that check.\n\n**Warning:** This action cannot be undone. To stop a control gating one policy without deleting it, remove it from that policy instead.",
