      "post": {
        "operationId": "createGovernanceControlVersion",
        "summary": "Create Governance Control Version",
        "description": "Changes what a governance control checks by appending a new version of its definition. The version that was current stays in the history with the verdicts computed against it, and the new one becomes what the next assessment runs against; existing verdicts are never recomputed or migrated. Which request shape is expected follows the control's own `type` — a pre-deployment control takes the pre-deployment config, every other type the runtime config — and every field is required even when `null`, so send the definition in full rather than a patch.",
