      "put": {
        "operationId": "updateGovernancePolicyControls",
        "summary": "Update Governance Policy Controls",
        "description": "Replaces the set of controls the governance policy attaches directly, changing what it gates its projects on from the next assessment onward. This is how a control comes to govern anything: a newly created control is attached to no policy, so it gates nothing until a policy attaches it here. Every id must name a control in your organization, or the whole request is rejected.",
