      "delete": {
        "operationId": "deleteGovernancePolicySkill",
        "summary": "Delete Governance Policy Skill",
        "description": "Permanently deletes the Agent Skill attached to a governance policy. Coding agents working on the projects it governs stop receiving `skills/governance/SKILL.md` on their next clone. The policy, its controls and its projects are untouched, since the skill instructs agents rather than gating anything. A policy that has no skill is reported as not found.",
