      "post": {
        "operationId": "createProjectInvitations",
        "summary": "Create Project Invitations",
        "description": "Invites people to this project by email, each with a link. Accepting can grow the organization too, not just the project. Addresses that already have an invitation to this project, or already belong to it, are dropped from the batch; if that leaves nothing, the request is refused as a conflict. The Free plan caps the organization's members plus invitations at 2. Only the invitations created are returned.",
