      "delete": {
        "operationId": "removeProjectMember",
        "summary": "Remove Project Member",
        "description": "Revokes a member's access to this project only: they are disconnected from it, their project role is deleted, and any outstanding invitation for their email on this project is cleared. They keep their organization membership and access to every other project, so this does not free up a seat. The project Owner cannot be removed, so transfer ownership first. Inviting the same address again brings them back with the default role rather than the one they had.",
