        "description": "Lists every project permission a project policy can grant. Each is named `resource:action` — `dataset:read`, `golden:create` — and its id is what you send in a policy's `permissionIds`. This is Confident AI's whole project catalog, not only the permissions this project already uses, and it is the same catalog for every project in your organization. Organization permissions are a separate catalog with its own endpoint.",
